blank signs only. Leave clean open cornflower-blue space for code-rendered Sticker overlays. 16:9 composition, 1600x900 PNG. NEGATIVE: no duplicate people, no extra characters beyond the requested count, no Andrea narrator, no skin-tone colors, no brown/tan/peach/pink cheeks, no readable text, no logos, no watermarks, no realistic UI, no decorative filler, no clutter, no clipped subject.
