y two people, Carol on the left with short curly light-gray hair and round glasses, a different angry male contractor on the right with cap and tool belt, Carol holding a clean `LIEN` paper, a raised arguing hand, a leaning ladder, open paint can, brush, a plain blue background with no wall or paint patch, no extra people, no ambient doodles, even blue margin, and nothing clipped at the edges.\n\n--- .planning/quick/260705-generate-carol-argue-scene/PLAN.md ---\n---\nstatus: complete\ncreated: 2026-07-05\nbranch: claude/course-production\n---\n\n# Generate Carol argue scene asset\n\n## Goal\n\nGenerate the requested two-person course scene PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol_argue.png`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Use `docs/design/style-ref-1.png` and `docs/design/style-ref-2.png` as exact flat sticker-sheet style references.\n- Use `docs/design/cast-board.png` and `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol.png` as Carol identity references.\n- Create one PNG at 1600 x 900.\n- Show exactly two people: Carol on the left and a different male contractor on the right.\n- Preserve Carol's short curly light-gray hair, round glasses, cream shirt, pale near-white cream face, sixties build, and frustrated arguing expression.\n- Show Carol with one hand raised and one hand holding a sheet marked `LIEN`.\n- Show the contractor in a cap and tool belt, angry and arguing back with a pointed or thrown-out hand.\n- Include a leaning step ladder and open paint can with brush between them.\n- Keep the cornflower-blue background plain and empty with no wall, gray patch, or paint patch.\n- Keep a single flat cornflower-blue background and the established yellow, orange, cream, white, black, and light-gray palette.\n- Avoid clones, extra people, extra heads or arms, ambient doodles, speech bubbles, motion marks, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, perspective, and extra text.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.\n- Confirm the file is a PNG and 1600 x 900.\n- Confirm the local palette check reports only the allowed flat colors.\n- Visually inspect for exactly two people, clean `LIEN` text, Carol identity, a clearly different contractor, and the repair props.\n\n--- .planning/quick/260705-generate-m02-l2b-carol-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md ---\n---\nstatus: complete\ncompleted: 2026-07-05\nbranch: claude/course-production\n---\n\n# Generate m02 L2B Carol scene asset summary\n\nGenerated `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol.png`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Used the image generation workflow with the requested `gpt-image-2` prompt and attached style references.\n- Treated Images 1 and 2 as exact sticker-sheet style references.\n- Treated Image 3 as the cast-board character and palette reference.\n- Selected the candidate with exactly one centered Carol portrait, no text, no props, no background doodles, and no extra people.\n- Preserved the generated source under `$HOME/.codex/generated_images/019f3062-f2f5-74a2-9b94-2b935ee4c98f/ig_04c76ce57c403b47016a49d47d0a488196ba2d0831a3cbda7a.png`.\n- Resized the final workspace PNG to 1600 x 900.\n- Flattened the final workspace PNG to the existing flat course palette: cornflower blue, light gray, cream, white, and black.\n- `course-assets/` is ignored by git as regenerable course video output.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `file course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol.png` reports PNG image data at `1600 x 900`.\n- `sips -g pixelWidth -g pixelHeight course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol.png` reports `1600 x 900`.\n- Local Sharp color check reports 5 unique colors: `#61AEEB`, `#D9D9D9`, `#FFF8CC`, `#FFFFFF`, and `#040404`.\n- Visual inspection confirms exactly one centered head-and-shoulders Carol portrait with short curly light-gray hair, round glasses, a cream shirt, a fed-up expression, one raised eyebrow, generous plain blue margins, no text, no ambient doodles, no props, no extra people, and no clones.\n\n--- .planning/quick/260705-generate-m02-l2b-carol-scene-asset/PLAN.md ---\n---\nstatus: in-progress\ncreated: 2026-07-05\nbranch: claude/course-production\n---\n\n# Generate m02 L2B Carol scene asset\n\n## Goal\n\nGenerate the requested course portrait PNG at `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol.png`.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Use the supplied images as style and cast references.\n- Create one PNG at 1600 x 900.\n- Show exactly one head-and-shoulders portrait of Carol.\n- Center the portrait with generous cornflower-blue margin on all four sides.\n- Use short curly light-gray hair, round glasses, and a cream shirt.\n- Show a frustrated and fed-up expression with pressed lips and one raised eyebrow.\n- Keep the flat sticker-sheet doodle style with thick wobbly black outlines and flat fills only.\n- Use the established yellow, orange, cream, white, black, and light-gray hair palette on a cornflower-blue background.\n- Avoid extra people, clones, text, words, ambient doodles, hearts, sparkles, notes, bubbles, motion marks, gradients, texture, shadows, lighting, and perspective.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Confirm the file exists at the requested path.\n- Confirm the file is a PNG and 1600 x 900.\n- Visually inspect for exactly one centered Carol portrait, even margins, no extra objects, no text, and flat sticker-sheet style.\n\n--- .planning/quick/260705-imz-generate-carol-lien-scene/SUMMARY.md ---\n---\nstatus: complete\ncompleted: 2026-07-05\nbranch: claude/course-production\n---\n\n# Generate Carol lien scene asset summary\n\nGenerated `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_carol_scene.png`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Used the built-in image generation workflow with the requested `gpt-image-2` prompt and attached style references.\n- The explicit local CLI path was unavailable because `OPENAI_API_KEY` is not set in this shell.\n- Treated Images 1 and 2 as exact sticker-sheet style references.\n- Treated Image 3 as the cast-board and palette reference.\n- Treated Image 4,