status: complete\ncompleted: 2026-07-06\nbranch: claude/course-production\n---\n\n# Generate m09 L9A Grace call scene asset summary\n\nGenerated `course-assets/scenes/module-09/m09_L9A_b02_grace_call.png`.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Checked the explicit local `gpt-image-2` CLI path first.\n- The requested final 1600 x 900 size cannot be generated directly by the CLI because `gpt-image-2` requires generated dimensions to be multiples of 16. The valid 16:9 generation size would be 2048 x 1152 followed by resize.\n- CLI dry-run confirmed the intended `gpt-image-2` edit payload using `docs/design/style-ref-1.png`, `docs/design/style-ref-2.png`, and `docs/design/cast-board.png`.\n- Real CLI generation was unavailable because `OPENAI_API_KEY` is not set in this shell.\n- Used the established built-in image generation workflow with the supplied references.\n- Selected source candidate `$HOME/.codex/generated_images/019f388a-dd12-76d3-89cf-9e6d58c13e6d/ig_0a053895fd2c5ce4016a4beb551aec8197bcbc0131c6754504.png`.\n- Resized the workspace PNG to 1600 x 900.\n- Flattened the workspace PNG to the course palette and forced the bottom-right 420 x 420 area to flat cornflower-blue.\n- `course-assets/` is ignored by git, so the PNG is saved locally but not tracked by default.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `file course-assets/scenes/module-09/m09_L9A_b02_grace_call.png` reports PNG image data at 1600 x 900, 8-bit/color RGB.\n- `sips -g format -g pixelWidth -g pixelHeight course-assets/scenes/module-09/m09_L9A_b02_grace_call.png` reports PNG, 1600 x 900.\n- PNG signature check reports `89504e470d0a1a0a`.\n- Local palette check reports 7 unique colors: `#111111`, `#62B3F3`, `#CCCCCC`, `#FF7A00`, `#FFD310`, `#FFF7DE`, and `#FFFFFF`.\n- Bottom-right 420 x 420 square contains only `#62B3F3`.\n- Visual inspection confirms one Grace in her yellow armchair, phone to ear, left-weighted composition, empty lower-right area, no text, and no ambient doodles.\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_