sult to the exact requested file.\ncodex\nI’m going to keep the artifact scope tighter than the repo workflow would normally want: no `.planning` files because your hard constraint says not to create anything outside `course-assets/scenes/module-10/`. Next step is the image generation call itself.\n--- b03.log\nhook: PostToolUse\nexec\n/bin/zsh -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom PIL import Image\nfor p in ['docs/design/style-ref-1.png','docs/design/style-ref-2.png','docs/design/cast-board.png','docs/design/object-board.png','course-assets/scenes/module-05-lesson5B/_anchors/seller.png']:\n    im=Image.open(p)\n    print(f'{p}: {im.size} {im.mode}')\nPY\" in $HOME/Sites/BMH apps/BMH Institute\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\n succeeded in 121ms:\ndocs/design/style-ref-1.png: (1504, 1128) RGB\ndocs/design/style-ref-2.png: (1504, 1128) RGB\ndocs/design/cast-board.png: (1536, 1024) RGB\ndocs/design/object-board.png: (1402, 1122) RGB\ncourse-assets/scenes/module-05-lesson5B/_anchors/seller.png: (720, 900) RGB\n\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\n--- b04.log\n                idx=i,\n                prompt=prompt,\n                n=n,\n                explicit_out=job.get(\"out\"),\n            )\n            downscaled = None\n            if args.downscale_max_dim is not None:\n                downscaled = [\n                    str(_derive_downscale_path(p, args.downscale_suffix)) for p in outputs\n                ]\n            _print_request(\n                {\n\nhook: PostToolUse\n exited 127 in 101ms:\nzsh:1: command not found: python\n\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\n--- b05.log\n  \"checker_model\": \"sonnet\",\n  \"verifier_model\": \"sonnet\",\n  \"commit_docs\": true,\n  \"branch_name\": null,\n  \"quick_id\": \"260706-jj5\",\n  \"slug\": null,\n  \"description\": null,\n  \"date\": \"2026-07-06\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"2026-07-06T19:03:46.753Z\",\n  \"qui