e data, 1536 x 1024, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\ndocs/design/object-board.png: PNG image data, 1402 x 1122, 8-bit/color RGB, non-interlaced\n\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\ncodex\nThe target folder exists and the requested file is not present yet. I’m generating one clean 16:9 still now, using the attached images as style references only, with extra pressure on “no readable text” because newspaper imagery tends to drift into fake letters.\n--- b09.log\n- sketch-to-render — drawing/line art to photoreal render.\n\n## Shared prompt schema\n\nUse the following labeled spec as shared prompt scaffolding for both top-level modes:\n\n```text\nUse case: <taxonomy slug>\nAsset type: <where the asset will be used>\nPrimary request: <user's main prompt>\nInput images: <Image 1: role; Image 2: role> (optional)\nScene/backdrop: <environment>\nSubject: <main subject>\n\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\ncodex\nOne constraint conflicts with the repo’s normal GSD workflow: your prompt says not to create files outside `course-assets/scenes/module-10/`, while GSD would create planning files elsewhere. I’m honoring the stricter asset constraint and keeping filesystem writes limited to the requested folder.\n--- b10.log\n\n### ${area_2_name}\n- ${decision_from_discussion}\n\n### Claude's Discretion\n${areas_where_user_said_you_decide_or_areas_not_discussed}\n\n</decisions>\n\n<specifics>\n## Specific Ideas\n\n${any_specific_references_or_examples_from_discussion}\n\n[If none: \"No specific requirements — open to standard approaches\"]\n\n</specifics>\n\nhook: PostToolUse\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\n--- b11.log\ndocs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:28:- **Design refs (repo):** `docs/design/style-ref-1.png`, `style-ref-2.png`, `cast-board.png`, `object-board.png`. Approved Andrea identity image: `course-assets/avatar-candidates/andrea_headset_v2.png`.\ndocs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:34:course-assets/scenes/module-<NN>/          # stills (m<NN>_L<X>_<tag>.png)\ndocs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:35:course-assets/heygen/lesson<X>/            # wavs, _state.json (word timestamps!), avatar clips\ndocs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:36:course-assets/heygen/lesson<X>/grok/       # animation clips (Seedance) — name anim_<tag>.mp4\ndocs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:37:course-assets/review-lesson<X>/            # deliverables to Jarrad\ndocs/course-production/MODULE-PRODUCTION-GUIDE.md:92:Copy render → `course-assets/review-lesson<X>/LESSON-<X>-v1-FULL.mp4` → SendUserFile to Jarrad with known-placeholder notes. Update `NEXT-SESSION.md` + scene cards + PLAYBOOK (new lessons learned) + vault `_inbox` capture + `_meta/log.md`.\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:7:# Generate Ray situational scene asset summary\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:9:Generated `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_ray_scene.png`.\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:13:- Used the built-in image generation workflow with the requested `gpt-image-2` prompt and attached style references because the local CLI path could not run without `OPENAI_API_KEY`.\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:15:- Treated `docs/design/cast-board.png` and `course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_ray.png` as identity and palette references.\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:19:- `course-assets/` is ignored by git as regenerable course video output.\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:23:- `file course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_ray_scene.png` reports PNG image data at 1600 x 900, 8-bit/color RGB.\n.planning/quick/260705-imq-generate-ray-scene-asset/SUMMARY.md:24:- `sips -g pixelWidth -g pixelHeight course-assets/scenes/module-02-lesson2B/m02_L2B_ray_scene.png` reports 1600 x 900.\ndocs/course-production/remotion/public/lesson2A/_concat.txt:1:file '$HOME/Sites/BMH apps/BMH Institute/course-assets/heygen/lesson2A/b01_intro.wav'\ndocs/course-production/remotion/public/lesson2A/_concat.txt:3:file '$HOME/Sites/BMH apps/BMH Institute/course-assets/heygen/lesson2A/b03_situations.wav'\ndocs/course-production/remotion/public/lesson2A/_concat.txt:5:file '$HOME/Sites/BMH apps/BMH Institute/course-assets/heygen/lesson2A/b04_inherited.wav'\n\nhook: PostToolUse Completed\ncodex\nThe local CLI cannot use the API directly because there is no `OPENAI_API_KEY` in this shell, and the approved 1Password service token is not available from Keychain here. The established local course workflow falls back to the built-in image tool for these course stills, then saves the selected PNG into `course-assets/`.\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"c9e9b7f7-5e95-47e6-9569-87b19c4e0053"}}}
