docs/course-production/scripts/gen_stills_18A.sh:103:      gen_priya "m18_L18A_b12_energy-management.png" "Energy management. Priya smiles before dialing at a clean workspace, one hand lightly touching headset, water bottle nearby, simple healthy lunch container or apple-like flat icon allowed only if palette-compliant, and a small blank small-win checklist with plain check marks but no text. Include a subtle break/walk/reset cue as a pair of simple shoes or path card, but no motion marks or decorative symbols. EXACTLY ONE PERSON." ;;
